jobs.description:
Are you looking for a stable full-time job in logistics where you can combine working with a reach truck with a variety of warehouse activities? Do you enjoy a hands-on role, work accurately, and feel comfortable in an international team? Then this Warehouse Operative position could be a great next step for you.

You will work in a modern distribution centre in Hazeldonk, where you will operate a reach truck but also be involved in picking, packing, loading, unloading, and other warehouse activities. You will work in both English and Dutch and have the opportunity to build a long-term career in logistics.

What are you going to do?
As a Warehouse Operative, you play an important role in the daily warehouse operation. You will use your reach truck certificate to safely move and store goods, but your work will involve much more than operating a reach truck. Together with your colleagues, you make sure incoming and outgoing goods are processed accurately and efficiently.

Key Responsibilities:

- Operating a reach truck to move, store, and retrieve goods safely;
- Picking, packing, and preparing customer orders for dispatch;
- Loading and unloading goods and checking incoming shipments;
- Performing quality checks and verifying product quantities and accuracy;
- Carrying out various physical warehouse activities, including lifting and moving packages of approximately 20–30 kg;
- Supporting colleagues with other logistics activities when needed.

Working Hours:

- Monday to Friday;
- Day shift;
- Full-time position of 40 hours per week.

What do we offer?
You will join a professional international logistics environment where you can use your reach truck experience while gaining experience across different warehouse activities. The company offers a stable working environment and opportunities to develop within logistics.

Besides this, you will receive:

- Gross hourly salary of €14.99;
- Full-time employment of 40 hours per week;
- Long-term employment opportunities;
